<title>UK: GSI sets calls on IBM Swiss certificates.</title>
<headline>GSI sets calls on IBM Swiss certificates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs Interntional has issued four million American-style call warrants, on IBM Swiss certificates, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one certificate.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    250 CHF		   PREMIUM	24 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.90 CHF		  GEARING	7.76 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.MAY.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	12.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  225 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
